{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>*WARNING* GAME CONTAINS FLASHING LIGHTS IMAGES AND LOUD SOUNDS!!!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a struggling Cartoonist who works for a large greedy TV network. You have been recently tasked with creating a new colorful cast of characters for your failing show. The stress of work, and some questionable things your boss says lead you to believe your creations may have come to life. Each night you must fend off each of your creations in any way possible as you slowly start to lose your mind. Maybe you're going insane, maybe it's the copious amount of drugs\u2026 who knows\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Turns to Day is an indie point and click horror game where the player has to manage resources and complete various tasks to fend off enemies in order to survive. The game offers high intense action and thrilling gameplay, with many secrets waiting to be discovered\u2026 Do you have what it takes to survive each night?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game offers a simple point and click style of gameplay that the player must use to fend off creation come to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity! The game offers a unique sanity system that provides ever changing challenges to the player\u2019s gameplay and visual field.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get familiar with the game\u2019s colorful cast of loveable animals all drawn in the game\u2019s simple and stylized artstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore! Your home is filled with many secrets waiting to be discovered. As you explore you will begin to uncover the hidden story behind what\u2019s really going on.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>*WARNING* The game contains heavy themes of drug and alcohol abuse. We do not condone the use of illegal drugs, or misuse of medical substances.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3932120?t=1760368105","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932120/636d9a7132737fb983c4904e20022ed85b483a92/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760368105","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932120/55643887dc05032d8c4171fa913204673d59db2e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760368105","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3932120/55643887dc05032d8c4171fa913204673d59db2e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760368105","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"*WARNING* The game contains heavy themes of drug and alcohol abuse. We do not condone the use of illegal drugs, or misuse of medical substances."},"demos":[{"appid":4096730,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>*WARNING* GAME CONTAINS FLASHING LIGHTS IMAGES AND LOUD SOUNDS!!!</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a struggling Cartoonist who works for a large greedy TV network. You have been recently tasked with creating a new colorful cast of characters for your failing show. The stress of work, and some questionable things your boss says lead you to believe your creations may have come to life. Each night you must fend off each of your creations in any way possible as you slowly start to lose your mind. Maybe you're going insane, maybe it's the copious amount of drugs\u2026 who know